  "details": "This is something that everyone with carpal tunnel, tendonitis, or various other hand related issues would be genuinely thankful for as it would allow them to participate in game worlds without experiencing pain.\n\nBut allowing something on the SDK Level for world authors to allow carryable items in game worlds to 'stick' to a players hands so they don't need to hold their grip down the entire time would be a very useful feature. \n\nI doubt many would complain if it was up to the world authors discretion.",
